[MouseFlight] Active for 3s and Mouse.current.delta has read EXACTLY ZERO the whole time, so the virtual stick cannot deflect and the vessel cannot turn. Mouse BUTTONS come from different controls and are unaffected, which is why this reads as the mouse half-working. Check the Input System's Update Mode (a project set to 'Process Events In Fixed Update' delivers no delta to Update - this project ships NO InputSystem settings asset, so it is on the package default) and that the Game view has focus with the cursor captured.
